<!-- Player: a Node script plays the "what" sound from init and from its first
     advance. Setter, Listener and Relay share the Game view model: Setter
     sets score from its second advance; Listener plays the sound when it
     changes; Relay's listener makes and advances an instance of Player, then
     plays the sound itself. -->
